# Reference crontab for the meteo-app server.
#
# Install with:  crontab scripts/crontab.reference
# Inspect with:  crontab -l
#
# Every entry runs from this repository checkout. The wrappers resolve their
# Python scripts relative to themselves, so a `git pull` updates the code that
# cron actually runs — no copying to /home/ubuntu/projects/scripts or
# /home/ubuntu/Downloads, which is how several jobs previously drifted onto
# stale copies (and missed the --disable-epsv fix during the FTP outage).
#
# All download jobs target a specific 5-minute slot rather than "whatever file
# is newest", and all filenames/slots are UTC.
#
# Paths are written out in full rather than via a variable: cron only exports
# NAME=value lines as environment, and relying on the shell to expand them in
# the command field is an avoidable bet.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# National PRD products (mosaic + ancillary)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh SRI_adj
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh VMI
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh ETM
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh VIL
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh IR_108 TIFF

# AMV shapefiles are published every 20 minutes, not every 5
5-59/20 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh AMV SHP

# Radar site availability
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_product_ftp.sh SITES TXT

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local radars
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Torchiarolo (Puglia) — one entry per product: they are published
# independently, so each job polls its own directory for its own file.
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_torchiarolo_ftp.sh SRI
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_torchiarolo_ftp.sh VMI
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_torchiarolo_ftp.sh ETM
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_torchiarolo_ftp.sh VIL

# Cagliari X-band — one run fetches all products for the slot
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_cagliari_ftp.sh

# WR10 mobile radar
*/6 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/download_wr10_ftp.sh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived products
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/FSS_computation/run_fss.sh >> /home/ubuntu/logs/fss_compute.log 2>&1
*/5 * * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/LK_computation/run_lk.sh  >> /home/ubuntu/logs/lk_compute.log 2>&1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Housekeeping
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
0 0 * * * /home/ubuntu/projects/Nowcasting_webapp/scripts/cleanup_old_predictions.sh >> /home/ubuntu/logs/cleanup_predictions.log 2>&1
